# Changeling's "every creature type" (CR 702.73a) is a characteristic-defining ability, not a word of the card's text
# (CR 612.1 changes only the words of its type line and rules text), so Artificial Evolution replacing Shapeshifter - the
# one creature type in Firdoch Core's type line - with Zombie leaves the Core every creature type, Shapeshifter and
# Zombie included. Bot1 casts the Core on turn 1 (Sol Ring and a Swamp) and the instant on turn 3 with Mox Sapphire.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Firdoch Core
Artificial Evolution
Mox Ruby
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

